<title>ITALY: Italian president meets Bank of Italy governor.</title>
<headline>Italian president meets Bank of Italy governor.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian President Oscar Luigi Scalfaro met the governor of the Bank of Italy, Antonio Fazio, on Wednesday, a statement from the president's office said.</p>
<p>It gave no further details. -- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
